00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:32.309
Some inventions changed the world. The printing press made books cheaper. The compass needle helped sailors find their way. The steam engine moved trains. Electric light let people work at night. The telephone line connected cities, and the aeroplane made travel faster. Penicillin saved millions of lives. The camera lens lets us keep memories.

